| `number`      | `double` (or `NSNumber` when used inside objects) | `double` (or `Number` when used inside objects)   | `number`       | `Napi::Number`                    |
| `string`      | `NSString`                                        | `String`                                          | `string`       | `Napi::String`                    |
| `BigInt`      | `NSString`                                        | `long` (or `Number` when used inside objects)     | `BigInt`       | `Napi::BigInt`                    |
